    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75381" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρτά̆λ-ῐχος</span></b> , ὁ, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρταλίς,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>chick,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				13.12
			</span></i> ; 
				Boeot.
			 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλεκτρυών,</span> acc. to
				<i><span class="en">
				Stratt.
				47.4
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				871
			</span></i> et Sch. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			generally, <i>young bird,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				54
			</span></i> (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρνιθες δροσερῶν μητέρες ὀρταλίχων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.291
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. χελιδόσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					5.579
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>young animal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				793
			</span></i> (anap.).</div>
